# Agent guide

Before changing this repo, read and obey root `AGENTS.md`.

- Never commit `secrets.h`, `wrangler.jsonc`, or `.dev.vars`; never put real domain/MAC/LAN/passwords in tracked files or the wake page.
- Keep `esp8266/NasWake/NasWake.ino` and `esp8266/src/main.cpp` (and both `certs.h` / `secrets.h.example`) in sync.
- Do not remove or rewrite Durable Object migration tag `v1`.
- Poll does not consume; only ack moves pending → consumed. WoL goes to subnet broadcast UDP/9.
